cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AI Sandbox in your research, coursework, or benchmarks, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "AI Sandbox: Emergent Behavioral Archetypes, Cognitive Fixation, and Specification Gaming in Multi-Agent LLM and RL Environments"
abstract: >-
  An open-source multi-agent experimental testbed for studying emergent
  behavioral archetypes (Warlord, Economist, Pilgrim), cognitive failure modes
  (perseveration loops, temporal discounting), Machiavellian diplomacy, dual-memory
  ablation, and reinforcement learning specification gaming under resource-constrained
  survival conditions.
